# archive/ holds MSSS CSVs byte for byte, exactly as served (urgences is
# Latin-1, the others UTF-8 with a BOM; all use CRLF line endings). -text turns
# off every newline/encoding conversion git could apply on add or checkout
# (core.autocrlf, eol), so the stored blob is the downloaded file. Diffs still
# work. linguist-generated folds these files in GitHub diffs and stats.
archive/** -text linguist-generated
